["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だから</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">所以；因此；那么；正因如此；我说过吧；我早就告诉你了</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203824\">だから<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にいたほうがいいよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所以,我们最好呆在家里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だめ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不好；没用；坏掉的；失效的；没希望；徒劳；白费；无意义；不可以；不能；不允许；（围棋）双方均不占有的交叉点；公空；不行！；停！</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75261\">もうだめだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">都结束了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">男性</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だんせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">男人；男性；（语法）阳性</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127151\"><ruby>男性<rp>(</rp><rt>だんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>上着<rp>(</rp><rt>うわぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>着用<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゃくよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">外衣是给男人买的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖房</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だんぼう</